+# 2026-10-17-gpt-native-context
+
+English | [中文](2026-10-17-gpt-native-context.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Adds durable GPT native compaction checkpoints, operation results, and request projections.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Compatibility](#compatibility)
+- [Verification](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## Declaration
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-10-17-gpt-native-context
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:context/checkpoint"
+    previous: null
