+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+All official V4 rows remain readable. These new events are required for correct replay and are not ignorable. An official unpatched V4 reader rejects them by unknown event type before reconstruction; the matched local patched reader preserves the original surface and selects the recorded request projection. The independent runtime and plugin travel together.
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## Verification
+
+Independent 13-package runtime imports and strict V4 encode/restore passed; stock official 0.2.1-rc.2 rejection passed. GPT plugin backend regression suite: 190 passed; UI suite: 38 passed.
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## Dev Note
+
+None.
