--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/persistence-changes/2026-10-17-gpt-native-context.zh.md
@@ -0,0 +1,64 @@
+---
+description: "记录持久化类型更改及其兼容性确认。"
+kind: persistence-change
+---
+
+# 2026-10-17-gpt-native-context
+
+[English](2026-10-17-gpt-native-context.md) | 中文
+
+## 概述
+
+增加GPT原生压缩检查点、操作结果和请求投影持久化事件。
+
+## 目录
+
+- [声明](#declaration)
+- [兼容性](#compatibility)
+- [验证](#verification)
+- [开发备注](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## 声明
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-10-17-gpt-native-context
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:context/checkpoint"
+    previous: null
+    after: "65333672caca8b88487855727c937678bba74861f1a3e97e4e99cd62919f30e7"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:context/checkpoint-commit"
+    previous: null
+    after: "99cf5431f4b25452c300c911df85b4323854ffbe06d3fd9a4ff145d32993fccb"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:context/operation"
+    previous: null
+    after: "38fd9dbaff2b91ddcdf21db2229bc15523a62fe6688975080b2efb1cd3f280a4"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:context/operation-result"
+    previous: null
+    after: "13d9aa72a1f9bbddb3c8c376a258f9b80abdb80ff9f34b8a5bc1c333791104d3"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:request/projection"
+    previous: null
+    after: "601170fbd4a73b4a591657d9af5f7f03ceae309c3dfc6df779405e18a17fd904"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## 兼容性
+
+官方V4记录仍可读取。新增事件是正确恢复所必需的事件，未标记为可忽略；未打补丁的官方V4读取器在重建前拒绝未知事件类型。匹配的独立宿主保留原始会话表面并选择已记录的请求投影。宿主与插件须成组部署。
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## 验证
+
+独立13包导入及V4严格编解码恢复通过，官方原版拒绝新增事件通过；GPT后端190项、界面38项回归通过。
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## 开发备注
+
+无。
