 <a id="understand-the-implementation"></a>
 ## Understand the implementation
 
+Request context selection is recorded separately from conversation history. `requestProjection()` returns the latest active selection, and `deriveRequestMessages()` uses its messages or the ordinary derived history when the selection is cleared. A projection with `messages: null` clears both selected messages and native adapter context. Context operation results and committed checkpoints remain durable log facts, so recovery can restore selected context without re-executing recorded tools.
+
