 ## Understand the implementation
 
+Callers check `supportsFileRemoval` before using `removeFile(target, { version }, signal, sandboxPolicy)`. The operation removes one observed regular file only; stale versions and directories are rejected, and unsupported providers reject without mutating storage. The local and sandbox providers preserve the per-call cancellation and mutation policy checks.
